# W2's second E2 batch: the arms that take an earlier arm's winner. At 16 sessions the best arm 4 cells, step cap 1024
# with no long-prefill threshold and the frozen box (512/256), were within noise of each other (V2V p95 2,167 and
# 2,215 ms over 50 turns, background goodput within 4%), so both go to 24 sessions, and the other arms run on the
# frozen box, the configuration every earlier result was measured on. Frozen-engine points first, then the flag
# variants, so the engine restarts three times.
#   benchmarks/e2/campaign.sh benchmarks/e2/w2b.campaign

# The frozen box at 24 sessions, and the gateway-side arms in front of it
arms/a4-b512-t256-s24.toml
arms/a6-cap2-s16.toml
arms/a6-cap8-s16.toml
arms/a6-reserve2048-s16.toml
arms/a8a-flow-s16.toml
arms/a8b-smg-s16.toml
arms/a8c-resubmit-s16.toml

# Factors on the frozen box: preemptive generation off, calls per GPU
arms/factor-no-preemptive-s16.toml
arms/calls4-s0.toml
arms/calls4-s16.toml
arms/calls6-s16.toml

# vLLM's own headroom knobs on the frozen box
arms/a5-watermark10-s16.toml
arms/a5-queued8192-s16.toml

# The other best step cap at 24 sessions
arms/a4-b1024-t0-s24.toml
